# The Spider: Thanksgiving's Zone, as the Scarecrow is Halloween's. Planted,
# with eight legs spread wide: a round striped body, a dark head with two big
# white eyes. Its web is drawn on the turf where the Scarecrow's reach ring is.
size 11 5 9
voxel 0.1
colors
  P purple
  d purpleDark
  l purpleLight
  w white
  k ink
